        <para id="element-252976925"><title>A Cluster Sample</title>Pick a <emphasis>cluster sample</emphasis> of restaurants from two cities. The number of restaurants will vary.</para>
        <list id="list-2359669372" list-type="enumerated">
          <item>Describe your procedure.</item>
          <item>Complete the table with your sample.
            <table id="tablefive" summary="This table is presented as a template for collecting data and contains a total of 25 blank cells.">
              <tgroup cols="5">
                <tbody>
                  <row>
